Package: sustainas
Type: Package
Title: Sustainability Analysis
Version: 0.0.2
Date: 2025-05-13
Authors@R: person("Weksi","Budiaji", email = "budiaji@untirta.ac.id", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description: There are some tools to measure a program sustainability. These include 
  Rapid Appraisal for Fisheries (Rapfish) <http://doi.org/10.14288/1.0074801>  
  and Sustainable Livelihood Analysis (SLA) <http://doi.org/10.1016/j.gloenvcha.2008.11.002>. 
  This package is intended to calculate Rapfish and SLA in a simple way.
  The validity measures are also included.
